OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F364A1788193203
OL,3,CCity sign most expensive 18-year-old
OL,4,Cin the Premier League history
OL,6,FManchester City have confirmed what is
OL,7,Fbelieved to be the most expensive
OL,8,Fteenage signing in Premier League
OL,9,Fhistory.
OL,11,FAyyoub Bouaddi is set to join the club
OL,12,Ffor a reported #85.6 million after
OL,13,Fcurrent club Lille agreed the record
OL,14,Ffee.
OL,16,FThe highly-rated 18-year-old Moroccan
OL,17,Fplayer signed a five-year contract,
OL,18,Fkeeping him at the Etihad Stadium
OL,19,Funtil June 2031.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/7
