PN,36402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F364A1788193203
OL,3,CCity sign most expensive 18-year-old
OL,4,Cin the Premier League history
OL,6,FBouaddi, who will wear the number 32
OL,7,Fshirt, the same number he wore at
OL,8,FLille, arrives in Manchester as one of
OL,9,Fthe most exciting young talents in
OL,10,FEuropean football.
OL,12,FDespite his age, he has already made a
OL,13,Fname for himself at both club and
OL,14,Finternational level.
OL,16,FThe midfielder made history at Lille
OL,17,Fby becoming the club's youngest-ever
OL,18,Fplayer when he debuted just three days
OL,19,Fafter his 16th birthday in October
OL,20,F2023.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
