FL,365,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F364A1788193203
OL,3,CCity sign most expensive 18-year-old
OL,4,Cin the Premier League history
OL,6,FBouaddi's reputation soared following
OL,7,Fa standout performance on his 17th
OL,8,Fbirthday, when he played a key role in
OL,9,FLille's memorable UEFA Champions
OL,10,FLeague victory over Real Madrid.
OL,12,FBouaddi continued to break records at
OL,13,FLille, surpassing a milestone
OL,14,Fpreviously set by Eden Hazard by
OL,15,Fbecoming the youngest player to reach
OL,16,F50 Ligue 1 appearances for the club,
OL,17,Fat just 18.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
