CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F364A1788193203
OL,3,CCity sign most expensive 18-year-old
OL,4,Cin the Premier League history
OL,6,FIn total, he made 96 appearances for
OL,7,Fthe French side and was instrumental
OL,8,Fin their third-place finish in Ligue 1
OL,9,Flast season.
OL,11,FOn the international stage, Bouaddi
OL,12,Fplayed a key role for Morocco at the
OL,13,F2026 FIFA World Cup, starting five of
OL,14,Ftheir six matches as the team reached
OL,15,Fthe quarter-finals.
OL,17,FSpeaking about his move, Bouaddi said:
OL,18,F"This is a very special day for me and
OL,19,Fmy family.
OL,26,@zD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/7
