PN,36405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F364A1788193203
OL,3,CCity sign most expensive 18-year-old
OL,4,Cin the Premier League history
OL,6,F"Manchester City are, for me, the best
OL,7,FClub in the world. It's a dream to be
OL,8,Fhere and be able to call myself a City
OL,9,Fplayer. I have spent most of my life
OL,10,Fworking hard to become the best player
OL,11,FI can be and reach the top of the game.
OL,13,F"I've watched City for many years, and
OL,14,FI love their style of play. City
OL,15,Falways try and play quality football.
OL,16,FAnd they have shown they are winners `
OL,17,Fthis Club feels like it's built to win.
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,365,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F364A1788193203
OL,3,CCity sign most expensive 18-year-old
OL,4,Cin the Premier League history
OL,6,F"The squad is world-class and Enzo is
OL,7,Fa top manager. And I'm really looking
OL,8,Fforward to playing at the Etihad
OL,9,FStadium, in front of all the fans.
OL,11,F"I have plenty of improving to do. I
OL,12,Fam only 18. I am happy with the
OL,13,Fprogress I have made so far, but I
OL,14,Falso know I can improve so much. This
OL,15,Fis undoubtedly the best place for me
OL,16,Fto do that.
OL,18,F"This Club demands trophies and I will
OL,19,Fgive everything to make sure we are
OL,20,Fchallenging for every title."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUzD@AOU|D@]O]
