OL,3,CCity sign most expensive 18-year-old
OL,4,Cin the Premier League history
OL,6,FBouaddi is City's fifth new signing
OL,7,Fthis summer, joining Elliot Anderson,
OL,8,FGeronimo Rulli, Jeremy Monga, and
OL,9,FPierce Charles in Pep Guardiola's
OL,10,Fevolving squad.
